From: Cycles Houdini stable rebase <stable-rebase@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:52:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Clear shader/SVM buffer modified flags after successful
 delivery; retain pending flags on a device error. Actual shader rebuilds
 still mark buffers dirty.

Locked-Patch: patches/0007-retain-clean-shader-buffers.patch
Locked-Patch-SHA256: f7f19d04d3f226d60d22d9b5a5fba074fc88662d494536b8c28857459e5812e2
Contract: docs/renderer-patch-contracts.md
Related-Fixture: tests/houdini_shader_retirement_smoke.py
Qualification: Source replay only; no new runtime qualification asserted.

Rebased-From: 7ccd415bc246ff049087de7382c1fbd39a320605
Previous-Patch: patches/0007-retain-clean-shader-buffers.patch
Previous-Patch-SHA256: f7f19d04d3f226d60d22d9b5a5fba074fc88662d494536b8c28857459e5812e2
Rationale: Shader/SVM modified flags can be cleared only after a successful upload; retaining clean buffers avoids redundant work while preserving error retry.
Contract: Clear shader/SVM buffer modified flags after successful delivery; retain pending flags on a device error. Actual shader rebuilds still mark buffers dirty.
Tests: tests/houdini_shader_retirement_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

diff --git a/src/scene/shader.cpp b/src/scene/shader.cpp
index 0a51f9d26178b7968531df8e348383a81344e3e1..d1b66577fb3d4b5c1b1f8405ecfee7861398afce 100644
--- a/src/scene/shader.cpp
+++ b/src/scene/shader.cpp
@@ -610,6 +610,12 @@ void ShaderManager::device_update_post(Device *device,
   /* This runs after kernels have been loaded, so can copy to device. */
   dscene->shaders.copy_to_device_if_modified();
   dscene->svm_nodes.copy_to_device_if_modified();
+  if (!device->have_error()) {
+    /* Retain clean buffers across camera-only updates. Recompilation frees
+     * and reallocates these arrays, which marks them modified again. */
+    dscene->shaders.clear_modified();
+    dscene->svm_nodes.clear_modified();
+  }
 }
 
 void ShaderManager::device_update_common(Device * /*device*/,
